[{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0162","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0162.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-0401","title":"Sun Solaris tip 本地缓冲区溢出漏洞","description":"Solaris 系统中 tip 命令存在本地缓冲区溢出漏洞，攻击者通过设置过长的 HOME 环境变量可触发缓冲区溢出，从而以 root 权限执行任意代码。该漏洞影响 Solaris 2.5/2.6/7.0/8 及更早版本，需要拥有本地系统访问权限才能利用。攻击者可通过编译并运行本地提权程序完成利用，危害等级高（CVSS 7.2）。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.2,"aliases":["CVE-2001-0401"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2001-06-18T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:54:14Z","remediation":"升级到 Solaris 10 或 11 以获取官方安全修复；如无法升级，立即移除 tip 二进制文件的 setuid 权限（chmod u-s /usr/bin/tip），并限制非授权用户本地登录以降低利用风险。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2001-03/0394.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/2475","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/6284","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20684","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/56b9e9b42ce0a91a448094549973b81cdf8e832e/cves/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0401.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/61756b9c4d4c30577cc003b0b28e3db71ca30a1e/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-0401.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-0401","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2001/CVE-2001-0401.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/5b92f5917a4a825187ccaac594f43456a77ea8f3/nvdcve/CVE-2001-0401.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/c08f31014d923b6c2975f73a4f0efab221c2f8a9/2001/CVE-2001-0401.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/0d9e690522c86144671671f4250daa9ba0347e09/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-04xx/CVE-2001-0401.json","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0401.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0401.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2001-0401.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0162.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0160","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0160.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-0399","title":"Caucho Technology Resin JavaBean 源码泄露漏洞","description":"Caucho Resin 1.3b1 及更早版本存在信息泄露漏洞，远程攻击者可通过在 HTTP 请求的 WEB-INF 路径前插入 `.jsp` 后缀，绕过 Servlet 容器的访问限制，直接读取 JavaBean 文件的源代码。该漏洞可导致应用程序的敏感业务逻辑、数据库连接信息及配置参数泄露，攻击者无需任何身份认证即可通过构造特制 URL 远程利用，影响范围包括 Caucho Resin 1.2 和 1.3 系列版本。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2001-0399"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2001-06-18T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:54:14Z","remediation":"升级至 Caucho Resin 1.3.1 及以上版本，该版本已修复通过 `.jsp` 前缀绕过 WEB-INF 目录限制的问题。由于 Resin 1.x 系列早已停止维护，建议迁移至 Resin 4.0.x 或更高版本，同时在 `web.xml` 中添加 `<security-constraint>` 规则禁止外部直接访问 `/WEB-INF/*` 路径，作为纵深防御措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=98633597813833&w=2","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/2533","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20722","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/56b9e9b42ce0a91a448094549973b81cdf8e832e/cves/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0399.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-0399","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2001-0399.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/61756b9c4d4c30577cc003b0b28e3db71ca30a1e/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-0399.json","https://github.com/jbeasl7/openvas-feed-sync-local/blob/0ca27158e3313c25f9fa1fe358be43c227fdedbe/openvas-feeds/nvt-feed/2023/caucho/gb_resin_CVE-2001-0399_active.nasl","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/1684cfa32e43376c48beb06819bce86de6ba421b/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-qv37-qfq4-c558/GHSA-qv37-qfq4-c558.json","https://github.com/zmerry/z-marvel.github.io/blob/581a79f0e7ceb8cdb3e444922154e004cca44bbb/vulbox/webvul/middle/Caucho%20Technology%20Resin%20JavaBean%E6%B3%84%E6%BC%8F%E6%BC%8F%E6%B4%9E(CVE-2001-0399).html","https://github.com/chushuai/wscan/blob/d154617a1da7302d292d7c3cce9dce39d85ddb0c/data/db_server.xml","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/5b92f5917a4a825187ccaac594f43456a77ea8f3/nvdcve/CVE-2001-0399.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_150900_151000.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2001/POC-AVE-2001-0160.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2001/EXP-AVE-2001-0160.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0160.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0155","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0155.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-0383","title":"PHP-Nuke 远程广告横幅URL修改漏洞","description":"PHP-Nuke 的 banners.php 脚本中存在未授权访问漏洞，远程攻击者可直接调用 Change 操作修改广告横幅链接地址，因该操作未对用户身份进行认证。攻击者无需任何权限即可将广告链接替换为恶意 URL，导致用户被重定向至钓鱼或恶意站点。该漏洞影响 PHP-Nuke 4.4 及更早版本，危害等级中等。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2001-0383"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2001-06-18T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:54:12Z","remediation":"升级 PHP-Nuke 至 5.0 及以上版本，该漏洞已在官方修复包中修补。如无法升级，在 banners.php 开头添加身份验证检查代码，限制 Change 操作仅允许管理员执行；或在 Web 服务器（如 Apache）层面通过 .htaccess 对 banners.php 目录设置访问认证，阻止未授权外部请求直接调用 Change 参数。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2001-04/0017.html","http://phpnuke.org/download.php?dcategory=Fixes","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/2544","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/6342","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20729","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/362345baaa3b0376b2369a7901885756e250334b/cves/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0383.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-0383","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2001-0383.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/4591185d8ea1fe47b6e30df3286bd52753a931ce/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-0383.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/1684cfa32e43376c48beb06819bce86de6ba421b/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-c2rq-2x5w-5prm/GHSA-c2rq-2x5w-5prm.json","https://github.com/jdkoftinoff/mb-linux-msli/blob/8adb103e34af9ff1d8d122e9ee2a1808836f0a14/uClinux-dist/user/nessus/nessus-plugins/scripts/php_nuke_installed.nasl","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2001/CVE-2001-0383.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_150900_151000.json","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--00ee9534-e6fa-4858-aae3-d7d6b389e938.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0155.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0154","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0154.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-0380","title":"Crosscom Olicom XLT-F XL 80 IM SNMP 默认 Community 字符串漏洞","description":"Crosscom/Olicom XLT-F XL 80 IM 设备（固件版本 V5.5 Build Level 2）存在默认 SNMP 团体字符串漏洞。设备内置了未公开的默认团体字符串 \"ILMI\"，远程攻击者无需认证即可利用该字符串通过 SNMP 协议读取或修改设备配置信息，可能导致敏感信息泄露或设备配置被篡改。该漏洞影响特定版本的 Olicom XLT-F 系列网络设备，攻击者只需网络可达即可利用，无需任何身份验证。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":6.4,"aliases":["CVE-2001-0380"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2001-06-18T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:54:11Z","remediation":"立即修改 SNMP 默认 community string，删除或更改 'ILMI' 为自定义复杂字符串；在设备 ACL 中限制 SNMP 仅允许受信管理 IP 段访问；在边界防火墙上阻断 UDP 161/162 端口的外部访问。建议联系厂商确认是否有固件更新可彻底修复此问题。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2001-03/0364.html","https://oval.cisecurity.org/repository/search/definition/oval%3Aorg.mitre.oval%3Adef%3A5718","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20892","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/362345baaa3b0376b2369a7901885756e250334b/cves/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0380.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-0380","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2001-0380.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/4591185d8ea1fe47b6e30df3286bd52753a931ce/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-0380.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/1684cfa32e43376c48beb06819bce86de6ba421b/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-fx24-mh4f-pc7p/GHSA-fx24-mh4f-pc7p.json","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x89000/88839/info.html","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2001/CVE-2001-0380.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_150900_151000.json","https://github.com/Freem93/grammar_nasl_v2/blob/63834ebb8cd6e97050e155291c7500ad53bb20c6/plugins/snmp_default_communities.nasl","https://github.com/entrysky/mageni/blob/c58dcc9bc43b7fb267bb10a8083ada356fbc81d1/plugins/2014/gb_snmp_get_community.nasl"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0154.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0153","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0153.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-0375","title":"Cisco PIX 防火墙 TACACS+ 认证请求洪水拒绝服务漏洞","description":"Cisco PIX 防火墙 515 和 520 设备运行 5.1.4 版本操作系统时，其 TACACS+ 认证模块存在拒绝服务漏洞。远程攻击者无需身份认证，通过向目标设备发送大量认证请求即可导致 CPU 资源耗尽，使防火墙无法正常处理网络流量。该漏洞影响 Cisco PIX 4.x/5.x 系列固件，CVSS 评分 5.0，危害等级中危。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2001-0375"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2001-06-18T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:54:11Z","remediation":"升级 Cisco PIX OS 至 5.3.1 或更新版本。5.3.1 已验证不会因认证请求洪泛而崩溃，仅记录\"too many pending auths\"并拒绝超量请求。同时可在 aaa-server 配置中缩短 timeout 值（如设为 3 秒），并启用审计日志监控异常认证流量作为补充缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=98658271707833&w=2","http://www.cisco.com/warp/public/707/pixfirewall-authen-flood-pub.shtml","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/2551","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/6353","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20734","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/ed228d55b7972f63e700a35a54fbcd94064b9ade/2001/CVE-2001-0375.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/34b929f9979d6d9d9584dfab31f29f50dcf08e3f/cves/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0375.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-0375","https://github.com/edoardottt/missing-cve-nuclei-templates/blob/115c94bd1da3cc18977d652d6e78c9f4a5dfc13b/data/year/2001.txt","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/4591185d8ea1fe47b6e30df3286bd52753a931ce/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-0375.json","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2001/CVE-2001-0375.md","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/e6b10ee602769bd7be4675bf10e3382c1f100e32/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-gpjg-cgg8-v765/GHSA-gpjg-cgg8-v765.json","https://github.com/arpitn30/nipper-ng/blob/a344e58392d528c168b74ccda5caa309923fff56/0.11.10/common/.svn/text-base/report-vulns.c.svn-base","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2001/CVE-2001-0375.json","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--1e8434e4-e747-4356-9479-689351b954ac.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0153.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0106","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0106.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-0265","title":"PGP 5.x/6.x/7.0 ASCII Armor 解析器任意文件创建漏洞","description":"Windows 平台 PGP 5.x、6.x 及 7.0.3 及更早版本中的 ASCII Armor 解析器存在任意文件创建漏洞。攻击者可通过向目标用户发送特制的恶意 ASCII 装甲格式文件，当用户使用受影响版本 PGP 处理该文件时，解析器未能正确校验文件路径，导致可在任意目录创建文件。该漏洞 CVSS 评分仅 2.1，危害等级低，攻击复杂度高，需用户交互触发。","severity":"LOW","score":2.1,"aliases":["CVE-2001-0265"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2001-06-18T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:53:59Z","remediation":"立即升级到 PGP 7.0.4 或更高版本以修复 ASCII Armor 解析器路径遍历缺陷。PGP Desktop 产品线已停止维护，建议迁移至 GnuPG 等活跃维护的 OpenPGP 实现，避免使用不受支持的旧版本。如暂时无法升级，应在使用前严格校验 .sig 等 ASCII Armor 格式签名文件的来源可信度，不打开来源不明的签名文件。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.atstake.com/research/advisories/2001/a040901-1.txt","http://www.osvdb.org/1782","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/2556","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/6643","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20738","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/b5b2b32751baccad543d82143784e310554463ae/cves/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0265.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-0265","https://github.com/rundeck/rundeck/blob/408c5d3dda3d7834ec6c635ab01bab044b346fa0/cve-suppress.xml","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2001-0265.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/affa68d6539dbc90b6b6e0e1e746facb4aae08df/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-0265.json","https://github.com/chris-anley/papers/blob/49022789f281abb9549bf3d8df12a62acf6a6554/cve-ids.md","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2001/CVE-2001-0265.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_150900_151000.json","https://github.com/andreafioraldi/ToolsForCyberChallenge/blob/197d3dfd204cf1b9d1af1451455c8831c3ff9948/generated/files_0.list.dict"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0106.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0104","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0104.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-0264","title":"Gene6 G6 FTP Server 用户凭证泄露漏洞","description":"Gene6 G6 FTP Server 2.0（又名 BPFTP Server 2.10）存在用户凭证泄露漏洞。当用户查询位于网络共享上的文件信息时，服务器会向共享所在主机发送 NETBIOS 认证凭据，攻击者可通过嗅探同一网络段上的通信流量捕获这些凭据，进而获取目标系统的访问权限。该漏洞影响 Gene6 G6 FTP Server 2.0 版本，攻击者只需与受影响的 FTP 服务器建立连接并请求网络共享路径上的文件信息即可触发。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2001-0264"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2001-06-18T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:53:59Z","remediation":"升级 Gene6 G6 FTP Server 至 2.2 以上版本以修复凭证泄露问题；如在关键业务中无法升级，建议在 FTP 服务器上禁用 NetBIOS over TCP/IP，并在防火墙层面限制对 FTP 服务器 21 端口的访问仅允许受信来源 IP，同时启用 TLS/SSL 加密传输保护所有认证流量。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.atstake.com/research/advisories/2001/a040301-1.txt","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/2534","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20723","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/b5b2b32751baccad543d82143784e310554463ae/cves/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0264.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-0264","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2001-0264.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/affa68d6539dbc90b6b6e0e1e746facb4aae08df/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-0264.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/1721417c5dc7c1cbf858e5ea5a5245ea62e70cce/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-vr33-2xp3-c44r/GHSA-vr33-2xp3-c44r.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/5b92f5917a4a825187ccaac594f43456a77ea8f3/nvdcve/CVE-2001-0264.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_150900_151000.json","https://github.com/andreafioraldi/ToolsForCyberChallenge/blob/197d3dfd204cf1b9d1af1451455c8831c3ff9948/generated/files_0.list.dict","https://github.com/akabe1/windows_exploit_dowser/blob/11b24e36173cd382721db28581e575faf687d06b/cve_from_exploitdb_website.csv"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0104.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0103","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0103.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-0263","title":"Gene6 G6 FTP Server 文件存在性泄露漏洞","description":"Gene6 G6 FTP Server 2.0（又名 BPFTP Server 2.10）存在文件属性泄露漏洞。当未启用\"显示相对路径\"选项时，远程攻击者可通过 FTP 协议的 SIZE 和 MDTM 命令探测 Web 根目录之外的文件属性，从而获取服务器上敏感文件的存在性、大小及修改时间等信息。该漏洞影响版本 2.0，CVSS 评分 7.5，危害等级高，攻击者无需身份认证即可利用。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2001-0263"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2001-06-18T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:53:59Z","remediation":"升级 Gene6 G6 FTP Server 至 2.0 以上版本（如已停产则迁移至其他维护中的 FTP 服务器软件）；在服务器配置中启用 \"show relative paths\" 选项，阻止 SIZE 和 MDTM 命令返回 Web 根目录外的文件路径信息；同时在防火墙层面限制对 FTP 端口（21/TCP）的访问来源，仅允许受信 IP 连接。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.atstake.com/research/advisories/2001/a040301-1.txt","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/2537","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/6330","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20726","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/b5b2b32751baccad543d82143784e310554463ae/cves/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0263.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-0263","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2001-0263.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/affa68d6539dbc90b6b6e0e1e746facb4aae08df/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-0263.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/1721417c5dc7c1cbf858e5ea5a5245ea62e70cce/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-9xm5-646v-mfcw/GHSA-9xm5-646v-mfcw.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/5b92f5917a4a825187ccaac594f43456a77ea8f3/nvdcve/CVE-2001-0263.json","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x3000/2537/info.html","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_150900_151000.json","https://github.com/akabe1/windows_exploit_dowser/blob/11b24e36173cd382721db28581e575faf687d06b/cve_from_exploitdb_website.csv"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0103.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0473","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0473.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-1163","title":"Munica Corporation NetSQL 远程缓冲区溢出漏洞","description":"Munica Corporation 的 NetSQL 1.0 存在远程缓冲区溢出漏洞，攻击者可通过向 6500 端口发送特制的超长 CONNECT 参数触发缓冲区溢出，导致远程代码执行。该漏洞无需身份认证即可远程利用，CVSS 评分为 10.0，危害等级严重，可完全控制目标系统。Exploit-DB 上已有公开的利用代码。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":10.0,"aliases":["CVE-2001-1163"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2001-06-16T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:55:42Z","remediation":"Munica Corporation NetSQL 1.0 已停止维护，官方不再提供安全补丁。建议立即卸载 NetSQL 并迁移至其他受支持的数据库软件；如无法立即卸载，在防火墙/网络边界处将 TCP 端口 6500 加入黑名单，仅允许可信 IP 访问，并监控该端口的异常流量。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/2885","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20936","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/257ebb29696cc311841c79ca4ceb0162bf5df44a/cves/2001/1xxx/CVE-2001-1163.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-1163","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/41644568d1e47f962c2cefae75c8b09359290a26/2001/1xxx/CVE-2001-1163.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/2b92b509a6091f543702b902d36eba35e2393da1/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-1163.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/1c8e3f4146e1bef501493d1237acb1611ea8f707/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-6jrr-899w-f59m/GHSA-6jrr-899w-f59m.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2001/CVE-2001-1163.json","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x3000/2885/info.html","https://github.com/hungryfoolou/Vulnerability_Mining/blob/3df1d8ed0489ae1228f975ae1f58a690aae53886/craw/cveid_craw/cveid_craw/data/cveid_by_kind/cveid_overflow.txt","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Exploit-List-Ja/blob/b82432e7d59d95db9f183c0cefa7744595784afa/2001.tsv","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/add906b6a8ba20fd533c6fdd7f023c73e6090f3a/nvdcve/CVE-2001-1163.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0473.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0450","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0450.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-1077","title":"Rxvt rxvt 本地缓冲区溢出漏洞","description":"Rxvt 2.6.1/2.6.2 的 tt_printf 函数存在缓冲区溢出漏洞，本地用户可通过向该程序传递超长的 -T 或 -name 命令行参数触发缓冲区溢出，导致攻击者能够以当前用户权限执行任意代码或提升至更高权限。该漏洞影响 Rxvt 2.6.1 及 2.6.2 版本，攻击前提是拥有本地系统访问权限，利用难度较低，CVSS 评分 4.6，危害等级中危。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":4.6,"aliases":["CVE-2001-1077"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2001-06-15T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:55:32Z","remediation":"升级 rxvt 至 2.6.3 或更高版本，该版本已修复 tt_printf 函数缓冲区溢出问题。如无法升级，建议限制本地用户对 rxvt 的 SUID 权限，移除 setuid bit：`chmod u-s /usr/bin/rxvt`，或替换为 rxvt-unicode (urxvt) 等维护中的终端模拟器。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["http://download.immunix.org/ImmunixOS/7.0/updates/IMNX-2001-70-028-01","http://www.debian.org/security/2001/dsa-062","http://www.linux-mandrake.com/en/security/2001/MDKSA-2001-060.php","http://www.securityfocus.com/archive/1/191510","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/2878","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/6701","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20928","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/d426ca16061eaa1a65a39ea953ac0efe02aa4cae/cves/2001/1xxx/CVE-2001-1077.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-1077","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/291c09f8f1fb3b2fa866c7b93e7660471419cef8/2001/1xxx/CVE-2001-1077.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/db2f5eda64b048f89c93b57f05c779b62a05c5c9/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-1077.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/fa1c2f93b0d15da115c038738e571c1a1553b4cc/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-52cr-77wg-32m2/GHSA-52cr-77wg-32m2.json","https://github.com/rhuitl/uClinux/blob/0486e80a025dccbe4a2213715a2ab8a5063ea86b/user/nessus/nessus-plugins/scripts/debian_DSA-062.nasl","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/c54e59752dddfc9aa36c13774164384cfa0d1f04/content/CVE-2001-1077.md","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_151000_151100.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2001/CVE-2001-1077.json","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x3000/2878/info.html"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0450.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0538","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0538.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-1344","title":"cgiCentral WebStore 400 管理员身份认证绕过漏洞","description":"cgiCentral WebStore 400 的 WSSecurity.pl 认证脚本存在身份认证绕过漏洞。远程攻击者通过向该脚本提供一个已存在的文件名，可利用空字符截断或路径遍历（../）技术绕过管理员身份验证，从而未授权访问 WebStore 管理后台。攻击者无需任何凭证即可远程利用该漏洞，成功利用后可获取管理员权限，进而控制整个 WebStore 应用。该漏洞影响 cgiCentral WebStore 400 版本，CVSS 评分 7.5，危害等级高。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2001-1344"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2001-06-12T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:56:05Z","remediation":"该产品（cgiCentral WebStore 400）已停止维护且不再提供安全更新，建议立即迁移至受支持的现代购物车系统。如无法立即迁移，可采取以下缓解措施：在 Web 服务器配置中限制对 ws_mail.cgi 及 WSSecurity.pl 的访问，仅允许受信 IP 调用；删除或重命名 Statistics/ 目录下的可写文件；在 CGI 入口处过滤 %00（空字节）和 ../ 等路径遍历字符。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2001-06/0142.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/2860","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/6685","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20914","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/0db929612f090dc6aa0346061c42364c4634c480/cves/2001/1xxx/CVE-2001-1344.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-1344","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/5ea14f17ec38fb7850c23056beec64877fabc5b1/2001/1xxx/CVE-2001-1344.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/bb772dcb04525a1a88049530e1b1081f8633cb88/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-1344.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/d91e95989ea5d3a9186ceb621d53a71