性。攻击者可能利用此漏洞执行任意代码或获取未授权访问。建议用户及时更新到最新版本以修复此问题。","severity":"LOW","score":2.1,"aliases":["CVE-2001-1277"],"sources":["redhat"],"published":"2001-06-11T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:55:57Z","remediation":"建议立即升级 man 软件包至 1.5i2 或更高版本以修复该漏洞。对于基于 Debian/Ubuntu 的系统，可执行 `apt-get update && apt-get install man-db`；对于基于 Red Hat/CentOS 的系统，可执行 `yum update man` 或 `dnf update man-db`。如暂时无法升级，作为临时缓解措施，可移除 man 组中不受信任用户的写入权限，或通过 `chmod o-x /usr/sbin/makewhatis` 限制非 root 用户执行 makewhatis，防止利用 shell 元字符覆盖任意文件。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-25T00:00:00Z","references":["http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=99227597227747&w=2","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2001-072.html","https://bugzilla.redhat.com/bugzilla/show_bug.cgi?id=41805","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/dbab824db2d42b734971c1b87553018066aa35d2/cves/2001/1xxx/CVE-2001-1277.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-1277","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/beabc13489602b94b6c532f1aa3931e9e9fc2bc0/2001/1xxx/CVE-2001-1277.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/e6a16668a1632a04fd23488d1308b95bb656fd69/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-1277.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/458762a518138a26e597ac195eb82ce6c30238eb/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-ccvr-q2fw-7j4w/GHSA-ccvr-q2fw-7j4w.json","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x89000/88024/info.html","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2001/CVE-2001-1277.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_151000_151100.json","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--45381fa8-8524-414b-99fc-b9072c10a1ca.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/7c450063cd3f12f7aa97a070bb18c68d6bc6767e/content/CVE-2001-1277.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0397.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0501","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0501.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-1263","title":"Pragma Systems InterAccess TelnetD Server 4.0 拒绝服务漏洞","description":"Pragma InterAccess 4.0 build 5 中的 telnet95.exe 组件存在缓冲区溢出漏洞，远程攻击者可通过向 TCP 端口 23 发送大量特制字符触发该漏洞，导致 telnetd 服务进程崩溃，造成拒绝服务。该漏洞无需身份认证即可远程利用，攻击复杂度低，影响运行 Pragma InterAccess TelnetD Server 4.0 的系统。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2001-1263"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2001-06-06T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:55:55Z","remediation":"该产品 Pragma InterAccess 4.0 已停止维护且无官方补丁。建议立即卸载该软件，迁移至支持 Windows 10/11 的现代 Telnet 服务器（如 Microsoft 内置 Telnet 服务或第三方开源实现）。临时缓解措施：在防火墙或路由器上限制外部 IP 对端口 23 的访问，仅允许受信任的管理地址连接。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["http://online.securityfocus.com/archive/1/189327","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/2834","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/6658","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20904","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/3fc46d7716e9a0dd9635d13e2bff8fffb122a860/cves/2001/1xxx/CVE-2001-1263.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-1263","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/5ea14f17ec38fb7850c23056beec64877fabc5b1/2001/1xxx/CVE-2001-1263.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/73cd39be077fdbedc5ca2ea7e2723723d25285cc/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-1263.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/1c8e3f4146e1bef501493d1237acb1611ea8f707/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-59hh-2m6g-6gq2/GHSA-59hh-2m6g-6gq2.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2001/